  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ming You is near the end of his life. Together with bitter taste, the lion’s heart burns with flames of resentment. It cannot endure immense bitterness. It claws its own stomach and dies. Ming You’s soul escapes through the hole, taking his immortal essence and Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        2041
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eat heart is a greater creation than bitter taste and swallow loss. Even if these two moves hit, they could only tilt the balance of victory and defeat. Eat heart is a fatal attack. Once it hits without ample preparation, it can decide the outcome almost instantly.",
      "chapters": [
        2053
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eat-heart",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul unleashes food path killer moves, bitter taste and swallow loss. Demon Immortal Qi Jue is hit by them. His body shakes, and he almost fails to sustain his own killer move. Lu Wei Yin uses suffering loss is a blessing. Demon Immortal Qi Jue benefits. His injuries start to recover. Bitter taste and swallow loss were countered. Spectral Soul’s two food path killer moves are countered. He suffers a backlash and severe injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        2055
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "against-demon-immortal-qi-jue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
